mantlejs:
MantleJS

A KubeJS addon for Mantle things.

 Current contents

- Custom Mantle books

 Bug report

Report bugs on GitHub.

 Tutorials

See GitHub.

An example to create a Mantle book.

 javascript
// Script type: STARTUP
MantleJSEvents.bookRegistry(event = {
 // Create the book here
 event.create("test")
 // Specify the book repository
 .addBookRepository("kubejs:book/test");
});
StartupEvents.registry('item', event = {
 // Create a book item
 event.create("test book", "mantle:book")
 // Set the book data
 .setBookData("test");
});

